# 🌱 Brennan's Gemini Capsule

Hi, I'm Brennan (he/they). Friends call me Kenny.

I'm Queer, Red River Métis, and work as an author and web developer.
I'm 30 years old, born in Winnipeg, Manitoba, and currently based in Mohkínstsis
in Treaty 7 territory (Calgary, Alberta).

